Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(mcp):=20count=20one-name-per-line=20roster?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20entries=20instead=20of=20any=20"name=20=E5=90=8C=E5=AD=B8/?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E8=80=81=E5=B8=AB"?=
